    "answer": "### NOISE POLLUTION & EFFECTS\nNoise is defined as unwanted, unpleasant sound. Measured in decibels (dB).\n* **Effects**:\n  * *Auditory*: Acoustic fatigue, sensorineural hearing loss ($>85\\text{ dB}$ for 8 hours).\n  * *Non-auditory*: Hypertension, sleep disturbance, chronic fatigue, anxiety, lack of concentration.\n* **Control**: Noise reduction at source (silencers), pathway protection (acoustic barriers, trees), and ear protection.",
