    "answer": "### CANCER EPIDEMIOLOGY & CONTROL\n* **Danger Signals of Cancer (CAUTION)**:\n  * **C**hange in bowel/bladder habits, **A** sore that does not heal, **U**nusual bleeding, **T**hickening/lump, **I**ndigestion, **O**bvious change in mole, **N**agging cough.\n* **Prevention of Cervix and Oral Cancer**: HPV vaccination, Pap Smears, and screening via VIA (Visual Inspection with Acetic acid) for cervix; tobacco cessation and oral visual checks for oral cancer.",
