    "answer": "### THE SUB-CENTRE\nThe Sub-centre is the peripheral outpost of the healthcare delivery system in India, acting as the primary contact point between the community and health services.\n* **Population Coverage Norms**:\n  * Plain Areas: **5,000 population**.\n  * Hilly/Tribal/Backward Areas: **3,000 population**.\n* **Staffing Pattern**: 1 Health Worker Female (ANM), 1 Health Worker Male, 1 voluntary worker.",
