    "answer": "### THE COMMUNICATION PROCESS & BARRIERS\n* **Process**: Source (sender) -> Message -> Channel -> Receiver -> Feedback.\n* **Barriers**: Physiological (deafness), Psychological (emotion, lack of trust), Environmental (noise, distance), and Cultural/Language (dialects, literacy, contrasting beliefs).",
