    "id": 337,
    "text": "Add a note on steps in PLANNING CYCLE.",
    "type": "SAQ",
    "chapter": "Health Planning and Management",
    "stars": 3,
    "answer": "### THE PLANNING CYCLE\nThe multi-step health administration process:\n1. Analysis of Health Situation -> 2. Establishment of Objectives -> 3. Assessment of Resources -> 4. Fixing Priorities -> 5. Formulating the Plan -> 6. Implementation -> 7. Evaluation.",
